# Bolg's Company: "{T}, Sacrifice another Goblin: Add {B}{R}." On turn 3 Bot1 controls only the Company, which cannot pay with
# itself (refused). Once a Goblin Assailant and a Swab Goblin are there the ability is offered; the Company is not among the Goblins
# it may sacrifice (refused), and sacrificing the Swab Goblin adds exactly {B}{R} and taps the Company. Mana abilities use no stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Bolg's Company
Goblin Assailant
Swab Goblin
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

